{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eebbe97288a2030d5554b32de1a6736e41865cebd235845254f187d95b865b4c", "ja": "（とあるオフの日に、千早と海まで遊びに来た。\nようやく雪も止んだが、やっぱりまだまだ寒いな……）", "zh": "（某个休息日，和千早一起到海边玩了玩。\n雪总算停了，不过果然还是很冷啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "b5f64b160b0683f99c527e1c3458601cdf284c9a79c26b5d2fa788411029e76b", "ja": "{$P$}。今日は海辺の散歩に、\n美味しいランチまで……ありがとうございました。", "zh": "{$P$}。今天在海边散步，还请我吃了美味的午餐……谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1002_p", "source_sha256": "47afaefbfac427cfe5debcd171c0ac48446473df5ceee7b131116bb318285e57", "ja": "いや、どちらかというと申し訳なかったな。\n寒い中、連れまわすことになってしまって。", "zh": "不，反倒是我觉得挺过意不去的。\n天这么冷，还拉着你到处走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "aa2aac9977a449a5879bc12c748870d8cad4a30abf5a33b5a4377a324532c2ab", "ja": "いえ、雪のちらつく海もとても素敵でした。\nそれにきちんと防寒はしてきましたから、大丈夫です。", "zh": "不，飘着雪的海边也非常美。\n而且我做好了充分的防寒准备，所以没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1004_p", "source_sha256": "59f5ae28d1a4e9f706b00a688808ea3fb8237aea93d506f6713bda7f591e09b3", "ja": "ああ、そのニット、すごく暖かそうだよな。\nそれに、千早によく似合ってるし。", "zh": "啊，那件针织衫看起来很暖和。\n而且也很适合千早。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "2e83f60a20257a465f752ee49e45ed9cfa9c3bb7654f613998470499f9e6124b", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます。\nチョコを買いに行った帰りに、お店で目について……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢。  \n买巧克力回来时，在店里一眼看中了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "0e90bb415dd196bda502befe198bfe7e6c89380baeaccc433eb856a2ee281cad", "ja": "今日、着ようと思って買ったので、\nその……よかったです。", "zh": "我是想着今天穿，所以才买的，\n那个……太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e8a7b1290dd663d1f21ecb5af95f283501449ad7c4f8e1f1aa4a540700e2fc0b", "ja": "そうだったのか。あっ、チョコもありがとうな。\nもらうと思ってなかったから嬉しかったよ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。啊，对了，谢谢你的巧克力。\n没想到你会送我，我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3c0510884688ef053710fa4c270b2ea3bd89b5b62dc6d77729bfbc867ec42755", "ja": "千早への慰労ってことで連れてきたのに、\nこっちばかりもらっちゃって、なんだか悪いな。", "zh": "本来是想带你来慰劳千早的，结果反倒一直是我在收礼物，总觉得有点过意不去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "1bb203b36ea9be6b38d82b921455b0950c3bb558eba21b6fcb6ed8611ab2a8d0", "ja": "そんなこと。私のほうこそ、\n今日は日頃のお礼をしたかったんです。", "zh": "哪有的事。其实是我才对，今天本来就想向您表达平日里的感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "eb98005a7b8988c2d9c29cf7fece88b5483d941a32cd42e3102c3cd7cdc54e36", "ja": "本当はチョコだけじゃなく、\nもっと気の利いたものも贈りたかったのですが。", "zh": "其实我不只是想送巧克力，还想送些更贴心的礼物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e2c331ec549eff5b56f4e699137b89078a0c833e36e430905873bfcae465ad6f", "ja": "そうなのか。チョコだけで十分嬉しいけど、\n何か候補があったのか？", "zh": "是这样啊。光是巧克力就已经让我很开心了，不过你原本还有什么候选吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "aa7cf8c30a5c40671e8ebcc8b7b8051a3fb756c1a0cf6bfbdfaa439d927dd8ba", "ja": "はい。他のお菓子や、日用品や時計……。\nあとは、そうですね……メッセージカードなんかを。", "zh": "是的。其他点心、日用品，还有手表……\n除此之外，还有……比如留言卡之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1013_p", "source_sha256": "fa1c2f2cfa18cb96ace9f62bafc075ff6d207672fc21700edbf5a826d0bed213", "ja": "おっ、千早からのメッセージカードか！\nそれはちょっと読んでみたかったかもな。", "zh": "哦，是千早送来的留言卡啊！\n这个我还真有点想读读看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "707dcdf4c96f36edddfca9b986dc5fb3d01e2523a018448e99b74b17cdbbbe05", "ja": "実際に、何枚か書いてみたのですが、\nなかなか満足できるレベルに至らなくて。", "zh": "其实我也试着写了几张，\n但怎么也达不到让自己满意的水平。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ce9ff34a093080864f36462a2f766aedcc281dedeb89d38627f29faa93d47255", "ja": "はは、そうだったんだな。でも、そうして\n悩みに悩んで、今日チョコをくれたんだな。", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这样啊。不过，你就是这样苦恼了又苦恼，今天才送给我巧克力的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "66dc56885673e958fc2bf514fea712dbc9f2d23a40e1c443e5ac21e296043b67", "ja": "そんな。……{$P$}は、\n何か欲しかったものなど、ありましたか？", "zh": "怎么会……{$P$}先生，有没有什么想要的东西呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "1903d2389dd78757feba0a0a6de32fd9cbaa00ee33312c0056d280edb3d4b29a", "ja": "よくよく考えれば、先に本人に聞けばよかったですね。\n気が回らず、すみません。", "zh": "仔细想想，之前直接问本人就好了。\n是我没考虑周全，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ed1f3010c305f671281033c3d20bc9402b72ce4f82c687e093790a8dc1d70221", "ja": "とんでもない。あらためて、ありがとう。\nお返し、楽しみにしてくれていいからな？", "zh": "没这回事。再次谢谢你。可以期待一下我的回礼哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "f5132ba8c8ce3c697677156e640340ab86efc1e35aa3cc538c4703d3f3535e01", "ja": "ふふっ……ありがとうございます。\nそう言ってくださるなら、楽しみにしていますね。", "zh": "呵呵……谢谢您。\n既然您都这么说了，那我就期待着啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1020_p", "source_sha256": "4cf3860e588336584d96081b19f4d2469695dac9cf667645c523d3f890730e4e", "ja": "じゃあ、お返しにはメッセージカードもつけよう。\nあ、参考までに。千早はどんなこと書いてたんだ？", "zh": "那我也在回礼里附上一张留言卡吧。\n啊，顺便问一下，千早写了些什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0424_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "4a47cd47f109dd5ba97b2ce601c8a1ff9488664b35ee79354f02bbafa7d10a6c", "ja": "えっ？\nそれは……内緒です！　ふふっ。", "zh": "咦？\n这个……是秘密！呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
